WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:03.070
- Okay, so before the board was digital,

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.730
did you ever turn the wrong letter around?

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.178
'Cause that would've kind
of ruined everything.

00:00:07.178 --> 00:00:08.040
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.967
- One time I did it. I was mortified.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:13.900
I don't even remember which
was the correct puzzle.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.730
It was either "Dr. Spock" or "Mr. Spock",

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.177
and I turned the M or
the D and it was like,

00:00:19.177 --> 00:00:22.850
(gasps), that's the
wrong letter, oh my gosh.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.200
So I mean, I'm scarred for life on that.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.190
- Wait what happened?

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.619
Did they have to like
throw that one out? Like...

00:00:29.619 --> 00:00:31.200
- They did.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.320
They had to throw it out
and put another one in.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.120
- [In-Person Guest] Yeah,
but one time in 40 years?

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.860
- I know, I'm like, one time only?

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.520
- Fortunately,

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.730
in 1997,

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.657
they changed the puzzle board,

00:00:42.657 --> 00:00:45.400
where I only touch the letters.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.950
And when I touch them,

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.620
I won't touch them unless they light up.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.190
So the mistake will not be mine.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.023
- [In-Person Guest] Oh.

00:00:51.023 --> 00:00:51.940
- Oh, I love that.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.460
Yeah. There's someone else under that bus.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.580
That's what I'd do.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.100
So you're doing Celebrity
Wheel of Fortune now,

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.110
so are famous people better or worse

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:00.416
than your usual contestants?

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:01.810
Cause that was pretty funny.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:04.201
It took a minute to get that L out. So.

00:01:04.201 --> 00:01:05.150
(Kelly and In-Person Guest laugh)

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.410
- [On-Screen Guest]
They're definitely fun.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.050
You know, they have a great time.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:12.620
And I'm really surprised
at how good they really do!

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.670
- Oh my gosh. I think I would
be nervous under the pressure,

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.730
but girl, I love some Wheel
of Fortune slot machines.

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:17.563
- I would do it.

00:01:17.563 --> 00:01:18.670
- Wait, you would do it?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.503
- I would do it.

00:01:19.503 --> 00:01:22.033
- I'd try, but I would not do
well. Probably I'd be nervous.

